.TH SCPRO 1 "2026-10-27" "SCPro 2.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
scpro \- VS Code-styled deployment console for robot software
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B scpro
.RB [ \-\-check ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B SCPro
packs a local source tree with exclude rules, checks the target over SSH and
uploads the result with rsync.  Hosts are taken from
.IR ~/.ssh/config ,
projects are described in
.IR ~/.config/scpro/projects.yaml .
.PP
The graphical interface shows the resolved remote path for every project,
streams the deployment log and keeps the last 30 runs in
.IR ~/.local/state/scpro/logs .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-check
Do not open a window; print the resolved hosts and projects.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/scpro/projects.yaml
Project list, host rules and exclude profiles.
.TP
.I ~/.config/scpro/deploy_config.yaml
Current host, directory suffix and workspace root.
.TP
.I ~/.config/scpro/deploy_secrets.yaml
Optional per-host SSH passwords (mode 0600).
.TP
.I ~/.cache/scpro/
Generated theme icons and local upload packages.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/scpro/logs/
Run logs, rotated to the last 30 files.
.SH SEE ALSO
.UR https://github.com/macitry/SCPro
.UE
